PART C - GENERAL

C.1 Default classification. A file or directory is a Core Component only if
Schedule 1 includes it and Schedule 2 does not. Any file not listed in
Schedule 1 is a Simulation Component. If a file carries an
SPDX-License-Identifier header, that header controls for that file.

C.2 Trademarks. This license does not grant permission to use the names,
logos, or trademarks of the copyright holder, except as needed to describe
the origin of the work and to reproduce the notices this license requires.

C.3 No financial service. All components are software. Nothing in this
repository is, or implies, a licensed financial, payment, custody,
deposit-taking, or token-issuance service, or a statement that any such
service is authorized or insured. Simulation features do not involve real
funds. Anyone who operates software from this repository is solely
responsible for the legal and regulatory obligations of doing so.

C.4 Future changes. The copyright holder may license future versions
differently. A copy of a Core Component you have already received under
Apache-2.0 remains under that license.


SCHEDULE 1 - CORE COMPONENTS

 1. Database:
      db/migrations/001_* through db/migrations/021_*
      db/tests/
 2. Backend source: src/, except the paths in Schedule 2
 3. Backend tests: test/
 4. Web application: web/, except the paths in Schedule 2
 5. Operational tooling: scripts/, except the paths in Schedule 2
 6. Documentation and repository infrastructure:
      docs/, architecture.md, README.md, CHANGELOG.md, CONTRIBUTING.md,
      SECURITY.md, Dockerfile, compose.yaml, compose.wal.yaml, deploy/,
      .github/, .env*.example, .dockerignore, .gitignore,
      package.json, package-lock.json, tsconfig.json


SCHEDULE 2 - SIMULATION COMPONENTS

 1. Database:
      db/migrations/022_* through db/migrations/034_*, and any later
      migration that creates or alters objects they define
 2. Backend source:
      src/monetary/
      src/institution/
 3. Web application:
      web/app/money/
      web/app/developers/
      web/app/admin/network/
      web/app/admin/partners/
      web/app/admin/platform/
      web/app/admin/program/
      web/app/admin/reserves/
      web/app/admin/evidence/
      web/test/browser/money.spec.ts
 4. Operational tooling:
      scripts/phase16-*
      scripts/lib/institution-provider.mjs
      scripts/lib/network-iso.mjs
      scripts/lib/network-trust.mjs
 5. Any other file whose primary purpose is to implement the monetary
    (stablecoin) simulation, the institutional tenant platform, the
    simulated financial network, or the programmable-finance sandbox.
